Generate {{ num_docs }} realistic English resume/CV excerpts following these rules.

## Rules
- Each resume must be independent with different candidates
- Mark PII entities with the following XML tags:
  - <PERSON>full name</PERSON>
  - <ADDRESS>full mailing address</ADDRESS>
  - <ORGANIZATION>school, company, or institution name</ORGANIZATION>
  - <DATE_OF_BIRTH>date of birth</DATE_OF_BIRTH> (only when applicable)
- Include both the personal information header and work/education history sections
- Mix name formats: first-last, with middle name, with suffixes (Jr., III)
- Addresses should include street, city, state, zip code
- Organizations should include companies, universities, and professional associations
- Each resume excerpt should be 100-300 words

## Output format
Separate each resume with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`

## Topic examples
- Fresh graduate resume, experienced professional CV, academic CV with publications, part-time job application, executive resume with board memberships